6cgoz6zQg1uFFVowb-ywfx2ECsFQk6LazkXfQEhU6mzZ6VG2XNc6GINM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQjA90aZuHKow36X0jQNoGCjnq1vF_3JfjC56wmSEoh8A&oe=6B09A779"}, {"file_name": "ClassicLevel1players2.png", "id": "4666897716913378", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499628446_4666897720246711_271661554039611454_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rDd0a6tpFxUQ7kNvwErwise&_nc_oc=Adq5FvLSaF_5uoX4x8ZoiUyHsHJHoyVr0JhLx3cuKtMt3KSQY8jsNbeYAh5KAEDT7SA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRTSgl_Q_6HdeExhu6gNJ58BIrAU1xl1F8nD9ye4H3t_A&oe=6B09CE62"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "BLOOPERS", "keywords": ["party", "Obstacle", "battle", "funny", "multiplayer"], "long_description": "# Race. Jump. Fall. Laugh. Repeat! \ud83d\ude02\n\nWelcome to BLOOPERS! You're a wobbly bean racing through crazy obstacle courses. Jump over gaps, dodge silly traps, and race your friends to the finish line!\n\n**Up to 10 players. Tons of chaos. Endless laughs!**\n\n\n# \ud83c\udfc6 RACE TO THE FINAL!\n\nCan you survive all 3 rounds?\n\n- **Round 1:** Race fast! Only half the players qualify.\n- **Round 2:** Dodge obstacles and make it to the final!\n- **Round 3:** Go for the win! Only one Blooper becomes the champion!\n\nOops, you fell? No worries! Respawn and keep racing!\n\n# \ud83c\udfae PLAY YOUR WAY!\n\n- **Quick Match:** Jump into a race with random players.\n- **Private Match:** Host a match and race with your friends.\n- **Solo Practice:** Practice your jumps and master the courses.\n\n**Ready, set, WOBBLE! \ud83c\udf89**", "short_description": "VR obstacle battle game where you race, dodge and survive hilarious challenges with friends!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://rangesh06.github.io/bloopers-vr-privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Spawn Bridge", "support_website_u